  "idea": {
   "start": 17.935,
   "end": 46.175,
   "chunks": [
    {
     "text": "Airspace is air-traffic control for coding agents.",
     "start": 17.935,
     "end": 20.995
    },
    {
     "text": "It keeps a live graph of your code in FalkorDB: every function, every call, and the shape of each call.",
     "start": 21.275,
     "end": 27.795
    },
    {
     "text": "The agents live on the same graph. What each one claims, and every caller and test two hops out, is its airspace.",
     "start": 28.075,
     "end": 35.415
    },
    {
     "text": "Every edit is checked against the graph before it is written.",
     "start": 35.695,
     "end": 38.545
    },
    {
     "text": "If it would break another agent's work, it is held, and the agent is told why.",
     "start": 38.825,
     "end": 42.995
    },
    {
     "text": "The decision is a Cypher query, not a model call.",
     "start": 43.275,
     "end": 46.175
    }
   ],
