  "preflight": {
   "start": 80.485,
   "end": 101.53,
   "chunks": [
    {
     "text": "Pre-flight plans the work before any agent starts.",
     "start": 80.485,
     "end": 83.635
    },
    {
     "text": "On the real Flask repo, five tasks come back in about 20 milliseconds:",
     "start": 83.915,
     "end": 88.195
    },
    {
     "text": "two pairs must coordinate, with the path between them, and one task is free to run.",
     "start": 88.475,
     "end": 92.915
    },
    {
     "text": "Each task's reach is a Cypher traversal, the groups are connected components, and the explanation is a shortest path, all in FalkorDB.",
     "start": 93.195,
     "end": 101.53
    }
